                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1c6fe2a2-8f80-3f68-b170-befd78c7fe22",
                        "entry_id": "5138f36a-9015-34cd-8f3c-787ecbcfc92e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To invent again something that has already been invented."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03d537c5-1607-4d2d-a560-b917bb9b03dc",
                                "sense_id": "1c6fe2a2-8f80-3f68-b170-befd78c7fe22",
                                "text": "A narrative circulates at Mitchell, Hall about a naive young employee who, in his eagerness to be creative, \"reinvents the wheel,\" devoting so many hours reformulating work that has already been done that he drives himself into a nervous breakdown."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a73acb98-aa5e-4306-b791-c580563340fe",
                                "sense_id": "1c6fe2a2-8f80-3f68-b170-befd78c7fe22",
                                "text": "Overprocessing. The big problem in this area is a lack of standardization. A lot of time is spent reinventing the wheel. There are a lot of similar activities, and the lead time (set-up time) for reinventing the process should be eliminated."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f59e7fb6-bd6c-3026-bb3f-43740a23f0dc",
                        "entry_id": "5138f36a-9015-34cd-8f3c-787ecbcfc92e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To adapt into a different form; to give a new style or image to."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0eb29784-8aa6-4d4d-bb00-7843211e30cc",
                                "sense_id": "f59e7fb6-bd6c-3026-bb3f-43740a23f0dc",
                                "text": "He had the ability to reinvent himself as needed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dea078a9-7edd-46be-959f-68b71ee620f0",
                                "sense_id": "f59e7fb6-bd6c-3026-bb3f-43740a23f0dc",
                                "text": "The compulsion to expose, renegotiate, or reinvent the strengths and weaknesses of dance tradition offers little in its final outcome to attract the average dance-goer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c771fa31-3a2c-4f73-9b9d-b57fba4aa444",
                                "sense_id": "f59e7fb6-bd6c-3026-bb3f-43740a23f0dc",
                                "text": "When Lew Wasserman reinvented the studio system, leadership skills grew harder to find and the number of modern studio conglomerates boiled down to six, as discussed in chapters 15 to 20."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b2436f3-94b4-4d16-904f-a7b0d82282c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "5138f36a-9015-34cd-8f3c-787ecbcfc92e",
                        "source_sense_description": "to invent again something that has already been invented",
                        "target_lang_word": "heruitvinden",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heruitvinden",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbf1a24b-438d-3ae4-95e5-37ae5e610f7e",
                                        "entry_id": "f4eb60b4-cc77-37f8-bde3-a5501595fb6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "opnieuw uitvinden; opnieuw ontwerpen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d1747ff-ceb2-4b27-8785-48976fdbb9ce",
                                                "sense_id": "dbf1a24b-438d-3ae4-95e5-37ae5e610f7e",
                                                "text": "\"De traditionele media moeten zich heruitvinden door een nieuwkomer in deze wereld. Ze maken duidelijk dat zij bepaalde normen en waarden hebben\", zegt Duits. \"Al hebben de traditionele media ook veel over voor de beste roddel, en dat is zeker niet altijd chic.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f6c9dcd-8b0d-4a71-baea-08ebecdf82d6",
                                                "sense_id": "dbf1a24b-438d-3ae4-95e5-37ae5e610f7e",
                                                "text": "Intussen hopen vooral de kleinere reisorganisatoren op een snelle doorstart van D-reizen. Met ruim 1100 medewerkers en 285 reisbureaus in Nederland was het een belangrijk verkoopkanaal voor vakantiereizen. 'D-reizen heeft een enorme naamsbekendheid en decennialang reizen van touroperators gekocht. We moeten ons een beetje heruitvinden', zegt Van Dongen. De touroperator kan de schade opvangen, maar zegt dat het wel noodzakelijk is dat er vanaf juni weer kan worden gereisd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0396a381-600e-41d8-b3d4-4ceb6124b56c",
                                                "sense_id": "dbf1a24b-438d-3ae4-95e5-37ae5e610f7e",
                                                "text": "Heruitvinden: De afgelopen dagen spraken de berichten over Trump's gezondheid elkaar tegen. De eerste medische briefing van Trump's artsen, zaterdag, gaf niet op alle vragen over de gezondheid van de president antwoord. Zijn lijfarts Sean Conley weigerde bijvoorbeeld te zeggen of Trump zuurstof had gekregen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db5dcdfe-b461-4ab6-9740-d698317ce7d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5138f36a-9015-34cd-8f3c-787ecbcfc92e",
